# Secrets. The runtime stage copies only the binary, so these never reached the
# image that ships — but `COPY . .` put them in a build layer, and a build layer
# is something that gets pushed to a registry and pulled by whoever can read it.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
secrets/
*service-account*.json

